                    <chunk name="param_input" index="3">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Name of load case combination for which to retrieve results. If no input is provided, the results for the default load case are retrieved. The default load case is either the one selected by the nearest upstream component or the first active load case if no load case selection has been made. If you're unsure about the current default load case, you can connect the model to a panel, which will display the relevant information.</item>
